          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE 1: Integer Slider\n\nIn this first example we've created an integer slider with a min and max of -10 and 10.\nThe bounds of the slider can be set in the node inspector.\nHere you can also disable the min and max together, allowing the user to use whatever value they want.\nGive it a try, change the min/max and disable them"
          }
        },
